 315:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_gpio.c ****  * @brief  Set or clear the selected data port bit.
 316:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_gpio.c ****  * @note   This function uses GPIOx_BSRR and GPIOx_BRR registers to allow atomic
 317:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_gpio.c ****  * read/modify accesses. In this way, there is no risk of an IRQ occurring
 318:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_gpio.c ****  * between the read and the modify access.
 319:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_gpio.c ****  *
